# Autumn glitter leaves: bright orange and cream specks over textures (opt-in; off by default).
# A general speckle effect for any CHIM texture set: change `targets` to choose the textures.
# Origin: the look of CHIM-TEXTURE-SPECKS-33, kept on purpose. Its three colours are the sky-bank
# entries those specks sat on, in the same shares (47:51:2), so they glow with the sky's tint at
# dawn and dusk. Density: 2 % of texels, between that world's walls (about 1 %) and its busiest
# street ground (3 to 5 %).
# Format: docs/chim/TEXTURE_EFFECTS.md (reader: tools/chim/texfx.py).
effect  = speckle
name    = autumn_glitter_leaves
colour  = 255 174 66 47
colour  = 255 232 160 51
colour  = 153 38 79 2
density = 0.02
size    = 1
seed    = 1
targets = *
